/*
This post will be updated with slides and picture after the meetup.

== Meetup announcement

OtaNix ry and Nitor welcome you to the 2nd ever Nix meetup in Finland. The meetup is held at the Nitor office at Aleksanterinkatu 46 A, Helsinki on the 8th of September starting at 17:00.

Food and refreshments will be served during the event. We open the floor for anyone in the community to give a short presentation. If you'd like to give a presentation, please mention it in the sign up form.

Sign up now! https://pilvi.lajp.fi/apps/forms/s/Sc3s3e9SY4zgCrKGTctKnBgs
*/

OtaNix ry organized a Nix Meetup in Finland on the 8th of September 2025 together with #link("https://nitor.com")[Nitor].
The meetup was the successor for the #link("https://fi.nix.ug/meetups/first-meetup/")[first Finnish Nix meetup] organized a year ago. Food, snacks, and drinks were served to the attendants.

== Presentations
Apart from networking, the meetup featured presentations on various interesting Nix related topics. Some of the topics are listed below:
- A showcase of ephemeral rootfs setups with flakes by #link("https://github.com/jhvst")[Juuso]
- Migrating from Arch to NixOS by #link("https://github.com/Jaakkonen")[Jaakko]
- The `meow` cli tool by #link("https://github.com/PixelSergey")[Sergey]
- Running desktop apps in VMs, qubes/spectrumos-style by #link("https://github.com/SomeoneSerge")[SomeoneSerge]
- Rust & Nix by #link("https://github.com/lajp")[Luukas]

Stay tuned for upcoming Nix related events organized by OtaNix ry!

